{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o008e","title":"曹操在己吾起兵","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o008e-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操至陈留散家财募兵，冬十二月于己吾起兵讨董卓。","evidence":["wudi-e-o008e-q"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-86f02dc5d2e0b3a4c15f","label":"裴注·《魏书》","text":"太祖始起兵于己吾，鲍信与弟鲍韬以兵应之","evidence":["cuimao-q-c51997feaabc6ad8510a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"募兵起兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o008e-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0065","role":"以兵应太祖者","evidence":["cuimao-q-c51997feaabc6ad8510a"]},{"person":"cuimao-p0071","role":"以兵应太祖者","evidence":["cuimao-q-c51997feaabc6ad8510a"]}],"place":{"text":"陈留、己吾","evidence":["wudi-e-o008e-q"]},"time":{"label":"中平六年冬十二月","year":189,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o008e-q","wudi-q-o008","wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855"],"chronology":"wudi-y189","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o008","basis":"中平六年冬十二月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,62,"O008e"],"order":44}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"cuimao-p0071","name":"鲍韬","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0065","name":"鲍信","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-c51997feaabc6ad8510a","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"是岁，太祖始起兵于己吾；信与弟韬，以兵应太祖","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":144,"end":166,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o008e-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"太祖至陈留〖15〗，散家财，合义兵，将以诛卓。冬十二月，始起兵于己吾〖16〗。﹝四﹞是岁，中平六年也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":121,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c8312ddce42041c69855","layer":"modern","quote":"〖14〗杀太后及弘农王：董卓杀何太后在中平六年（公元 189），但杀弘农王则在第二年的正月。见《后汉书》卷八《灵帝纪》、卷九《献帝纪》。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-449cc7b499c8a1fee35c","start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o008","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"卓到，废帝为弘农王而立献帝〖7〗，京都大乱。卓表太祖为骁骑校尉〖8〗，欲与计事。太祖乃变易姓名，间行东归〖9〗；﹝二﹞出关〖10〗，过中牟〖11〗。为亭长所疑〖12〗，执诣县。邑中或窃识之〖13〗，为请得解。﹝三﹞卓遂杀太后及弘农王〖14〗。太祖至陈留〖15〗，散家财，合义兵，将以诛卓。冬十二月，始起兵于己吾〖16〗。﹝四﹞是岁，中平六年也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
